==Trivia==
*Bombergirl's seemingly arbitrary name is a pun that only works in Japanese. The Japanese word for bomb, ''bakudan'', happens to contain the word ''baku'', which can refer to either a [[wikipedia:Malayan tapir|Malayan tapir]], or a [[wikipedia:Baku (mythology)|dream-eating mythical creature]], both of which served as inspirations for [[Bakoo]]'s design.

